  x86 allmodconfig, no-op make, clang      13.9s     2.8s    -11.2s (-80%)
  x86 allmodconfig, clean, gcc            342.6s   306.6s    -36.0s (-11%)
  x86 allmodconfig, clean, clang          340.1s   290.2s    -49.8s (-15%)

